WEBVTT

00:14:59.829 --> 00:15:05.704
And it's clear that some people who are
irrationally persistent achieved great

00:15:05.704 --> 00:15:11.037
successes. And indeed, if you look
back at the great successes,

00:15:11.246 --> 00:15:15.287
you will generally find that there is some
irrational persistence behind them

00:15:15.537 --> 00:15:17.704
and irrational optimism behind them.

00:15:18.079 --> 00:15:21.537
That doesn't mean that when you are
looking from the other side,

00:15:21.787 --> 00:15:24.329
that irrational optimism or irrational

00:15:25.704 --> 00:15:28.537
persistence are good things to have.

00:15:29.121 --> 00:15:32.204
So the expected value of
it might be negative,